{"id":"n28934-1-9","stage":4,"title":"지점 · 分店","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28934-1-9-1","ko":"이 회사는 해외에도 지점이 있나요?","zh":"这家公司在海外也有分店吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사는","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해외에도","meaning":"海外，国外","explanation":"해외：海外，国外；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"해외","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62481","senseId":"1","lemma":"해외","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지점이","meaning":"分店","explanation":"지점：分店；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지점","audio":"/audio/66c785ce1f5d42b62f31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28934","senseId":"1","lemma":"지점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"82862092ebbd4ef9","term":"해외","zh":"海外，国外","audio":"/audio/82862092ebbd4ef94342.mp3","entryId":"62481","definition":"不是自己国家，别的国家。","pronunciation":["해ː외","해ː웨"]},{"id":"66c785ce1f5d42b6","term":"지점","zh":"分店","audio"